@startuml v1
title Imker - UML v1

hide circle
skinparam shadowing false

legend right
Toda tabla del servicio tiene _id y _owner asignados por ROBLE.
_owner = quién creó la fila.
Encima de la línea "--" va la PK
"*" = NOT NULL.
Llaves con underscore (user_id), atributos en camelCase (createdAt).
endlegend

' ───────── Entidades ─────────
entity user_system <<ROBLE>> {
* id : uuid <<PK>>
--
* user_id : uuid
* email : text
* name : text
* createdAt : timestamptz
* updatedAt : timestamptz
  extra : jsonb
  metadata : jsonb
}

entity profile {
* _id : uuid <<PK>>
--
  _owner : text <<FK user_system>>
* name : text
* career : json
  skills : json
  profilePicture : varchar
  description : text
}

entity project {
* _id : uuid <<PK>>
--
  _owner : text
* title : text
* imageUrl : varchar
* description : text
* jobs : json
* skills : json
* status : open | closed
}

entity project_saved  {
* user_id : uuid <<PK, FK>>
* project_id : uuid <<PK, FK>>
--
* createdAt : timestamptz
}

entity project_join_request {
* _id : uuid <<PK>>
--
* user_id : uuid <<FK>>
* project_id : uuid <<FK>>
* status : pending | approved | denied | cancelled
* createdAt : timestamptz
* updatedAt : timestamptz
  reviewed_by : uuid <<FK user_system>>
  reviewNote : text
}

entity project_member {
* user_id : uuid <<PK, FK>>
* project_id : uuid <<PK, FK>>
--
* role : owner | member
}

entity task {
* _id : uuid <<PK>>
--
* project_id : uuid <<FK>>
* title : text
  description : text
* status : todo | doing | done
}

entity contribution  {
* _id : uuid <<PK>>
--
* user_id : uuid <<FK>>
* project_id : uuid <<FK>>
* task_id : uuid <<FK>>
* description : text
* createdAt : timestamptz
}

' ───────── Relaciones ─────────
user_system ||--o| profile : "_owner "

user_system ||--o{ project_saved
project ||--o{ project_saved

user_system ||--o{ project_join_request : solicita
user_system |o--o{ project_join_request : "revisa"
project ||--o{ project_join_request

user_system ||--o{ project_member
project ||--o{ project_member

project ||--o{ task

project_member ||--o{ contribution : "(user_id, project_id)"
task ||--o{ contribution

' ───────── Notas ─────────
note bottom of contribution
BEFORE INSERT OR UPDATE (si es posible):
  validar que el member y la task
  sean del mismo proyecto.
end note

note bottom of project_join_request
Una sola solicitud pending a la vez
  por cada (user_id, project_id).
Las denied/cancelled quedan de historial.
end note

note bottom of project_member
PK (user_id, project_id): una membresía
  por usuario y proyecto.
Pendiente: qué pasa cuando alguien se va
(status o left_at).
end note

@enduml
